('127.877.d.9.F',3,'A technician cleans the old grease from a bearing, inspects the rollers, repacks it and installs it with a new seal. She is:','["painting", "guessing", "removing, cleaning, inspecting and repacking wheel bearings", "avoiding service"]'::jsonb,2,'Bearing service.','original'),
('127.877.d.9.F',4,'A wheel bearing that is worn out will often:','["reduce wear", "silence the car", "improve steering", "make a humming or growling noise that changes with speed"]'::jsonb,3,'Noisy bearing.','original'),
('127.877.d.9.G',3,'A technician pushes down on each corner of the car and watches how many times it bounces, then looks for oil on the strut body. She is:','["inspecting shock absorbers and struts for leakage and performance", "ignoring shocks", "painting", "guessing"]'::jsonb,0,'Bounce test.','original'),
('127.877.d.9.G',4,'A shock or strut that is leaking fluid usually needs:','["more air", "replacement", "more tape", "no action"]'::jsonb,1,'Leaks mean failure.','original'),
('127.877.d.9.H',3,'A technician presses out a damaged wheel stud and installs a new one, then tightens the lug nuts in a star pattern. She is:','["avoiding repair", "painting", "demonstrating wheel stud replacement and installation of wheel and tire assemblies", "guessing"]'::jsonb,2,'Stud replacement.','original'),
('127.877.d.9.H',4,'Lug nuts should be tightened in a star pattern to:','["look neat", "save nuts", "save time", "seat the wheel evenly and avoid warping the rotor"]'::jsonb,3,'Even torque.','original'),
('127.877.d.9.I',3,'A technician uses a TPMS tool to read each wheel sensor''s pressure and ID before a tire change. She is:','["identifying and testing the Tire Pressure Monitoring System", "measuring oil", "measuring tread", "measuring brake wear"]'::jsonb,0,'TPMS.','original'),
('127.877.d.9.I',4,'A TPMS warning light turning on usually means one or more tires:','["are overfilled", "are significantly under-inflated", "are balanced", "are new"]'::jsonb,1,'Low tire pressure.','original'),
